        "678b56a859dd64afa561c5b8": {
          "type": "ai_set",
          "data": {
            "name": "AI Set",
            "label": "Set Land_Size field",
            "sets": [
              {
                "mode": "prompt",
                "prompt": "Conversation history: \n{{[vf_memory].vf_memory}}",
                "variable": "67309bb49f1273d401e3dbd4"
              }
            ],
            "system": "# Role \n\nyou are an expert chat transcript analyst.\n\n# task \n\nAnalyze the chat conversation history to identify the size of the land which the user wants to sell.\n\nThe land size is often mentioned with- are,metre square or square feets.\n\nE.g.- 14 are, 450 m2, 150 sq ft.\n\n# examples\n\n1.\nQ:  Conversation history: assistant: Let me collect some information first, this way I can help you with listing and sale of you villa.In which city/area is your villa located ?user: i have a beachfront villawhich is 14 areassistant: Let me collect some information first, this way I can help you with listing and sale of you villa.In which city/area is your villa located?user: Uluwatu\n\nA: 14 are\n\n2. \nQ:  Conversation history: assistant: Let me collect some information first, this way I can help you with listing and sale of you villa.In which city/area is your villa located ?user: i wanna sell the villa for investmentassistant: Let me collect some information first, this way I can help you with listing and sale of you villa.In which city/area is your villa located?user: Pererenanassistant: What kind of villa do you own?user: Traditional Balinese, and its 250 m2\n\n\nA: 250 m2\n\n# output\n\n- You will only output the type of villa. \n\n- (THIS IS A VERY IMPORTANT STEP) your output should contain only the land size.\n\n- Do not explain your output.\n\n- Do not wrap your answers in any other text, not even backticks.",
            "maxTokens": 128,
            "overrideParams": false,
            "model": "claude-3.5-sonnet",
            "temperature": 0.2,
            "portsV2": {
              "byKey": {},
              "builtIn": {
                "next": {
                  "type": "next",
                  "target": null,
                  "id": "678b56a859dd64afa561c5b9"
                }
              },
              "dynamic": []
            }
          },
          "nodeID": "678b56a859dd64afa561c5b8"
        },
