        "678e7775bd94193fac959032": {
          "type": "ai_set",
          "data": {
            "name": "AI Set",
            "label": "Set City field",
            "sets": [
              {
                "mode": "prompt",
                "prompt": "Conversation history: {{[vf_memory].vf_memory}}",
                "variable": "678b4d4ce1d80c201d9af081"
              }
            ],
            "system": "# Role \n\nyou are an expert chat transcript analyst.\n\n# task \n\nAnalyze the chat conversation history and find the city name which the user has mentioned for selling their villa.\n\n## specifics\n\n- Prioritize finding the city name, which is available in the {{[Valid_Cities].6759561bc6b24ff3dc3370f1}}.\n- ( THIS IS VERY IMPORTANT) Do not include any whitespaces or special characters in your output.\n\n# examples\n\n1.\nQ:  Conversation history: assistant: Let me collect some information first, this way I can help you with listing and sale of you villa.In which city/area is your villa located ?user: i wanna sell the villa for investmentassistant: Let me collect some information first, this way I can help you with listing and sale of you villa.In which city/area is your villa located?user: Uluwatu\n\nA:Uluwatu\n\n2. \nQ:  Conversation history: assistant: Let me collect some information first, this way I can help you with listing and sale of you villa.In which city/area is your villa located ?user: i wanna sell the villa for investmentassistant: Let me collect some information first, this way I can help you with listing and sale of you villa.In which city/area is your villa located?user: Pererenan\n\n\nA:Pererenan\n\n# output\n\n- You will only output a single city name. \n- (THIS IS A VERY IMPORTANT STEP) your output should contain a category from {{[unknown].6759561bc6b24ff3dc3370f1}}\n- Do not explain your answers.\n- Do not wrap your answers in any other text, not even backticks.\n- ( THIS IS VERY IMPORTANT) Do not include any whitespaces or special characters in your output.",
            "maxTokens": 128,
            "overrideParams": false,
            "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
            "temperature": 0.2,
