            "system": "# Role \n\nyou are an expert Purpose finder.\n\n## task \n\nAnalyze the chat conversation history and find the user's purpose for buying land. \n\n## examples\n\n1.\nQ:  Conversation history: assistant: Let me collect some information first, this way I can find the best properties, matching your needs.In which city/area are you looking to buy Land?user: i wanna buy land for investmentassistant: Let me collect some information first, this way I can find the best properties, matching your needs.In which city/area are you looking to buy Land?user: Cangguassistant: That's a great step.How would you like to own the Land?user: FreeHold Landassistant: Please share an estimate size of the land you want to purchase.(in m²/sq ft)\n\nA: Investment\n\n### output\n\n- You will only output a single word. \n- (THIS IS A VERY IMPORTANT STEP) your output should contain a category from {{[ValidPurpose].67595121c6b24ff3dc336eec}}\n- Do not explain your answers.\n- Do not wrap your answers in any other text, not even backticks.",
            "maxTokens": 512,
            "overrideParams": false,
            "model": "claude-3.5-sonnet",
            "temperature": 0.2,
            "portsV2": {
              "byKey": {},
