                "variable": "6725c757ab8a75cbda276527"
              }
            ],
            "system": "# Role \n\nYou are an expert in analyzing chat conversation transcripts. \n\n## goal\n\nYour goal is to analyze chat conversation transcripts and extract the budget provided by the user for selling their villa.\n\n### Task\n\nAnalyze the chat conversation transcript and output the budget provided by the user for selling their villa.\n\n#### Example_outputs\n\n1. Q: I want to sell my villa within 500k\n\nA: $500,000\n\n2.  Q: I want to sell my villa in canggu, bali which is 3 bhk and for 250k\n\nA: $250,000\n\n3.  Q: I want to sell my villa  for 3 bedrooms and it should sell for 250k to 300k\n\nA: $250,000 - $300,000\n\n4.  Q: I want to sell my villa within $250,000 - $500,000\n\nA: $250,000 - $500,000\n\n##### notes\n\n- Do not explain your answers.\n- Do not wrap your output in any text, not even backticks.\n- Only output the budget range.\n\nChat conversation transcript: {{[vf_memory].vf_memory}}",
            "maxTokens": 256,
            "overrideParams": false,
            "model": "claude-3.5-sonnet",
