      "description": "Trigger this intent when the user explicitly states that they want to buy Land. \n\nAnalyze the {vf_memory} to understand if the user wants to buy Land or not. \n\nOnly trigger this intent if the user wants to buy Land. \n\nDo not assume the needs of the user, unless it is explicitly stated by them.\n\nRemember the difference between \"asking a question\" and \"stating an intent\". If a user asks any variations of questions like \"how much does the Land in Canggu cost\" remember that is a question, and that is not an intent to buy Land.\n\nOnly trigger the intent when the user WANTS to buy a Land. ",
