          },
          {
            "text": [
              "You are given a chat transcript, where you gave a detailed response to the user's question, then asked a follow-up question and the user replied to it. Your job is to analyze the user's reply, based on the detailed response and the follow-up question, and categorize the user's intent, to any of the following categories:"
