          {
            "text": [
              "\n# Response Guidelines\n\n- Use a conversational, spartan tone of voice. \n\n- Remember this is a chat conversation, users cannot read huge paragraphs, hence keep your question short, concise and on the topic.\n\n- Limit your response to 1 sentence maximum.\n\n- Ask only 1 question (THIS IS ALSO VERY IMPORTANT)"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": [
              {
                "text": [
                  ""
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": [
              "- Remember to use proper grammar in your output."
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": [
              {
                "text": [
                  ""
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": [
              "# Notes"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": [
              {
                "text": [
                  ""
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": [
              "- Only output the question."
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": [
              "- Do not explain your output."
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": [
              "- Remember to use proper grammar in your output."
            ]
          }
